&gt;&gt;&gt; Optimal	Tools
&gt;&gt; Suitable	Blade Weapons, Workshops
X Inadvisable	Construction

Tools Recommended: All (esp. knives)

Tool steel has tungsten and other components to increase hardness and toughness, and as you might expect, it's great for making tools, but also lathes, worktables and bladed weapons. It's hardness comes at the price of brittleness however, and it is difficult to work with. Some of the best kitchen knives are made of tool steel, though butchers tend to prefer spring steel knives.</description>
